{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Progress 2026-11-11 PST (session 3d705fec): plan revised (outbound-child lessons: test transports, inventories, suppression via withheld_releases, preview gating); review PASS first time, certified at 23e07e17e52; claimed via worktree CLI. Implemented as commit 4d21c744977 (23 files, all within file_impact). Adopted review advisories: alert resolution keyed on the full reason (archived->missing swaps alerts), no sink write when fixVersions is unobserved, best-effort alert writes, alert body without a redundant `release` key, and a static scan pinning that no reconciler module creates a Jira version. Known limit kept: an alert resolves when the name stops being withheld, before the Jira add is confirmed; a failed add is then logged and retried. Integration lifecycle passes on Cloud and DC backends (16 cases); reconciler/interfaces/scripts suites 8098 passed; lint (ratchets) and typecheck clean. make verify running."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1794385262139730964,"uuid":"ab30c9a9-55dd-407b-8556-227ad4a10f3b"}